WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.250
A rich man asks Jesus how
to inherit eternal life.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.250
He has kept the commandments.

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.290
Jesus tells him to sell all
he has and give to the poor.

4
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.580
He goes away sorrowful.

5
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:17.400
Jesus says a camel could pass through a
needle's eye more easily than a rich man

6
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.310
could enter God's Kingdom.

7
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.410
Yet some preachers today teach that God
wants every believer healthy and rich.

8
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:28.130
So why do some churches
say God wants you rich?

9
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:31.980
In this mission, you'll meet four
Christian responses to wealth.

10
00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:35.730
Then you'll ask: is wealth
a sign of God's blessing?

11
00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:40.120
Your mission: find out why some
churches say God wants you rich.
